  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The CLI supports headless runs via --prompt with options such as --directory, --max-tool-rounds, --format json, --batch-api, and --verify, plus session resume via --session latest or -s <session-id>. With --format json, headless output becomes a newline-delimited JSON event stream of semantic step-level events such as step_start, text, tool_use, step_finish, and error.",
